Manage password-login users for a team

Usage:
  mcp-runtime team user [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Add an existing platform user to a team or update their team role
  create      Create a password-login user and add them to a team
  list        List users in a team
  remove      Remove a user's membership from a team

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for user

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime team user [command] --help" for more information about a command.
